{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stick your head in a microwave to receive messages from god.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Microwave Yourself</i></strong> is a casual VR puzzle game. Find the correct combinations of items to put in the microwave (along with your head!) to unlock unique visual effects, music, and a message to advance your progress. You must find all three combinations in order to &quot;escape&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly jokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relatively short (30-120 minutes)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small, interactable environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840810/extras/4a2afe83dfe0508edbc5cc280dd8d6fc.avif?t=1755468756\" width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Free yourself from torment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Originally an academic project, this short VR experience is designed to take no longer than a couple of hours to complete. All music, art, and visual effects were made by a small team with love.)<br><br>(We also advise that you do NOT actually stick your head in a microwave!)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You need that.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3840810/6469db278e78c5347f5b113b8713d752a90bdf27.jpg"},{"name":"MORE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3840810/a745b72bd1f22dc65625d575e31b314800fb6b7c.jpg"},{"name":"FRAGILE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3840810/d8c3233cdce17d80f3705581a52c590821aff4be.jpg"},{"name":"CALM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3840810/a735447805276f0184f925b66aad59158e2f3212.jpg"},{"name":"Microwave Yourself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3840810/de3a5cf611a69d414a25ee03a52f6b4cafda1a1e.jpg"},{"name":"What's wrong with you?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3840810/835b0f75c88c7fe40801df814705d43330e0dd36.jpg"},{"name":"Skeleton Realm Live!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3840810/f64ca10dcdeda4e6dafa6418a3c6b624465bbe53.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840810?t=1755468756","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840810/8c137fad03104b118c91017893f562b62d14da78/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755468756","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840810/12abdac1e38bc5605b469995b0cd21be17aca36e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755468756","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840810/12abdac1e38bc5605b469995b0cd21be17aca36e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755468756","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The primary mechanic of this game is microwaving your head. However, there is no actual harm done by doing this other than some visual effects."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stick your head in a microwave to receive messages from god.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Microwave Yourself</i></strong> is a casual VR puzzle game. Find the correct combinations of items to put in the microwave (along with your head!) to unlock unique visual effects, music, and a message to advance your progress. You must find all three combinations in order to &quot;escape&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to expect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silly jokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trial and error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relatively short (30-120 minutes)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small, interactable environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840810/extras/4a2afe83dfe0508edbc5cc280dd8d6fc.avif?t=1755468756\" width=800 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Free yourself from torment.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Originally an academic project, this short VR experience is designed to take no longer than a couple of hours to complete. All music, art, and visual effects were made by a small team with love.)<br><br>(We also advise that you do NOT actually stick your head in a microwave!)</p>","developers":["Pallio Corp"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840810/14490cfff0b85b1782277e9f46aec5cd5e03daaa/header.jpg?t=1755468756","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3840810/1557389442/4ee287ab12d29801dfc236135aba48c6bdaf0a7f/1752010799/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752927282","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3840810/1557389442/4ee287ab12d29801dfc236135aba48c6bdaf0a7f/1752010799/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752927282","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/